1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,683
Minum air es...

2
00:00:01,683 --> 00:00:02,826
bikin gendut?

3
00:00:02,826 --> 00:00:03,710
Mitos...

4
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:04,558
atau fakta?

5
00:00:05,772 --> 00:00:06,964
Jawabannya...

6
00:00:06,964 --> 00:00:07,831
MITOS!

7
00:00:07,831 --> 00:00:08,411
Air es itu

8
00:00:08,411 --> 00:00:09,411
nol kalori!

9
00:00:09,411 --> 00:00:11,607
Tapi ada pelaku sebenarnya...

10
00:00:11,607 --> 00:00:12,489
di akhir video.

11
00:00:12,489 --> 00:00:13,144
Malah sebaliknya:

12
00:00:13,144 --> 00:00:15,525
air es suhunya sekitar empat derajat.

13
00:00:15,525 --> 00:00:17,050
Tubuh harus menghangatkannya

14
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:18,694
sampai tiga puluh tujuh derajat.

15
00:00:18,694 --> 00:00:19,704
Itu butuh energi:

16
00:00:19,704 --> 00:00:20,999
kira-kira enam belas kalori

17
00:00:20,999 --> 00:00:22,231
per setengah liter!

18
00:00:22,231 --> 00:00:23,303
Kecil sih,

19
00:00:23,303 --> 00:00:25,038
tapi jelas nggak bikin gendut.

20
00:00:25,416 --> 00:00:27,559
Jadi, siapa pelakunya?

21
00:00:27,559 --> 00:00:28,220
GULA!

22
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:29,832
Air es tawar: nol kalori.

23
00:00:29,832 --> 00:00:31,216
Es teh manis dua sendok gula:

24
00:00:31,216 --> 00:00:32,832
sekitar seratus kalori!

25
00:00:32,832 --> 00:00:34,377
Padahal batas gula sehari

26
00:00:34,377 --> 00:00:35,896
cuma empat sendok makan.

27
00:00:35,896 --> 00:00:37,493
Jadi, minum air es?

28
00:00:37,493 --> 00:00:38,903
Aman, asal tawar!

29
00:00:38,903 --> 00:00:39,625
Kirim ke temanmu

30
00:00:39,625 --> 00:00:42,091
yang masih takut minum es!

